### Try the API from VS Code (REST Client extension), Visual Studio, or Rider.
### Start it first:  dotnet run --project src/VendorFunding.Api

@host = http://localhost:5021

GET {{host}}/health

###
GET {{host}}/vendors

###
# Billback: 260 units purchased in March x $0.50 = $130.00
GET {{host}}/agreements/1/accrual?asOf=2026-03-31

###
# Scan-based: 200 units sold x $0.25 = $50.00, capped at $40.00
GET {{host}}/agreements/2/accrual?asOf=2026-03-31

###
# Lump sum: $3,100 over 31 days, 10 days in = $1,000.00
GET {{host}}/agreements/3/accrual?asOf=2026-03-10

###
GET {{host}}/agreements/1/claims

###
# Both March claims for agreement 1 already exist, so this returns 400.
POST {{host}}/agreements/1/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{ "periodEnd": "2026-03-20" }

###
GET {{host}}/reports/aging?asOf=2026-06-30
